+/* Plain-C libarchive front end for every non-RAR container the catalogue
+ * admits (.7z, .zip, .tar, .tar.gz …). RAR stays with the vendored UnRAR,
+ * which owns native multi-volume support. Codes mirror extract_unrar.h. */
